    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning two bedroom recently renovated mid terrace home with a stylish interior and a south facing garden.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional property features a gated driveway and pedestrian entrance leading to an elevated home with an attractive façade and new windows and front door.\r\n\r\nThe entrance hall boasts parquet floors which continue to the lounge area. To the right of the hallway is the original parlour room which could be used as a downstairs bedroom, a home office, a playroom or a separate living space. The spacious lounge enjoys eye catching colours, a solid fuel stove and understairs storage. The lounge benefits from an open plan layout with the kitchen & dining area which maximises the light and space. The kitchen itself has plenty of cupboard and counter space. The rear hallway has a skylight and doubles up as a pantry. The south facing garden is accessed via this hallway and is the perfect place to relax & entertain. The downstairs accommodation is completed buy a large fully tiled guest w.c. and utility room with high spec sanitary ware, a towel radiator and ample built in storage space. Comfy carpet on the stairs and landing continues to two double bedrooms, one to the front of the home and one to the rear. Both bedrooms have space for a home office and the main bedroom also features fitted wardrobes and an ornate fireplace. The generous sized family bathroom is fully tiled and has high spec sanitary ware and under sink storage. The attic is accessed via a Stira on the landing and is partially floored. This amazing home also benefits from solar panels and a new combi boiler.\r\n\r\nLally Road enjoys an excellent location with plenty of shops, cafes, bars, parks, playgrounds, schools and sports clubs nearby. The city centre is easily accessible by Dublin Bus while the N4 provides access to the greater Dublin area.\r\n\r\nItems included in the sale\r\n* Stoves double oven\r\n* New Beko dishwasher\r\n* Fridge freezer\r\n* Washing machine\r\n* Tumble dryer\r\n* Microwave\r\n* Two double-door wardrobes on the ground floor\r\n* New Clane Steel Shed\r\n* Blinds"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
